      "observed": "U1 (MAX3485) is assigned footprint Package_SO:SO-8_5.3x6.2mm_P1.27mm, a wide-body SO-8 land pattern.",
      "expected": "The MAX3485 datasheet and the symbol's own footprint filters specify an 8-SOIC narrow package (3.9 x 4.9 mm, 1.27 mm pitch) or DIP-8. The footprint should be the matching narrow SOIC-8 land pattern, e.g. Package_SO:SO-8_3.9x4.9mm_P1.27mm.",
