        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(property (name \"ki_fp_filters\") (value \"DIP*W7.62mm* SOIC*3.9x4.9mm*P1.27mm*\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The MAX3485 in its actual 8-SOIC narrow package will not fit the wider SO-8 pads, so the serial servo transceiver cannot be assembled reliably and the serial servo interface will be nonfunctional.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design has a U1 footprint mismatch: the MAX3485 is assigned a 5.3x6.2 mm wide SO-8 footprint even though its datasheet and library filters require a 3.9x4.9 mm narrow SOIC-8 footprint, preventing proper assembly of the serial servo transceiver."
}

